        <mxCell id="i16__r2__c1" value="Decoder. It compares the transfer address with the closed address window of every slave, raises the select of the owner, gives every slave its local address, forwards the transfer attributes, and returns the response of the selected slave or builds the response for an address that no slave owns. With a register option it adds flip-flops on the inputs, on the outputs, or on both, and a state machine that keeps the APB phases correct." style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;overflow=hidden;pointerEvents=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="i16__r2" vlsit_native_table="1">
          <mxGeometry x="330" width="1480" height="80" as="geometry">
